application routes, net cost and questions before accepting an offer.\",\"image\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/images/opportunities-20261024/research-1280.webp\",\"datePublished\":\"2026-10-29\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-10-29\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass Editorial Team\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/editorial-policy/\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"AspireCompass\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/logo.svg\"}},\"mainEntityOfPage\":\"https://aspirecompass.org/guides/sabanci-university-admissions-scholarships/\"}"}}],["$","script","3",{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"FAQPage\",\"mainEntity\":[{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Does Sabancı need a separate undergraduate scholarship application?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Its reviewed international scholarship page says eligible applicants are automatically considered. The optional scholarship indication does not replace the admission requirements or guarantee an award.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Is every Sabancı scholarship fully funded?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. Undergraduate tuition waivers and graduate award categories differ. Compare tuition, stipend, housing and other benefits in the specific written offer.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"Are the published graduate stipend figures for all master’s programmes?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"No. The quoted figures refer to the 2026/27 full-scholarship category. Professional programmes and other funding categories have different treatment.\"}}]}"}}]],"$L19",false,"$L1a","$L1b"]}]
