25:["$","section","3-Academic graduate funding: read the category and months",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-4","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Academic graduate funding: read the category and months"}],[["$","p","The university’s 2026/27 graduate page separates full, project and tuition-waiver support, alongside other named awards. Professional graduate programmes are excepted from its general academic-funding statement.",{"children":"The university’s 2026/27 graduate page separates full, project and tuition-waiver support, alongside other named awards. Professional graduate programmes are excepted from its general academic-funding statement."}],["$","p","For the full-scholarship category, the published master’s stipend is TRY 43,500 for 10 months; the doctorate category lists TRY 67,500 for 12 months. These are specific categories, not a promise to every admitted student. Read room availability and other benefit conditions in the official table.",{"children":"For the full-scholarship category, the published master’s stipend is TRY 43,500 for 10 months; the doctorate category lists TRY 67,500 for 12 months. These are specific categories, not a promise to every admitted student. Read room availability and other benefit conditions in the official table."}],["$","p","Build a graduate plan around supervisor or research fit, the programme’s document list and the category actually offered. A higher listed maximum in a different scholarship is not evidence of what your department will award.",{"children":"Build a graduate plan around supervisor or research fit, the programme’s document list and the category actually offered. A higher listed maximum in a different scholarship is not evidence of what your department will award."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://www.sabanciuniv.edu/en/graduate-scholarships",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://www.sabanciuniv.edu/en/graduate-scholarships","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Sabancı: 2026/27 graduate scholarship categories"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
26:["$","section","4-Prepare an application that can be evaluated",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-5","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Prepare an application that can be evaluated"}],[["$","p","Use the official admissions route for your degree. For a bachelor’s application, match your qualification to the published accepted exam/diploma list. For a research degree, follow the chosen graduate programme’s requirements and identify the work you want to pursue.",{"children":"Use the official admissions route for your degree. For a bachelor’s application, match your qualification to the published accepted exam/diploma list. For a research degree, follow the chosen graduate programme’s requirements and identify the work you want to pursue."}],["$","p","Keep a document inventory with the issue date, translation status and portal destination. If you are completing a qualification, confirm whether interim results are accepted and when the final document is due. The 2026/27 fee table does not itself announce a 2027 application deadline.",{"children":"Keep a document inventory with the issue date, translation status and portal destination. If you are completing a qualification, confirm whether interim results are accepted and when the final document is due. The 2026/27 fee table does not itself announce a 2027 application deadline."}]],["$","ol",null,{"className":"process-steps","aria-label":"Prepare an application that can be evaluated","children":[["$","li","Choose the degree and programme; open its official application instructions.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":1}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Choose the degree and programme; open its official application instructions."}]]}],["$","li","Check accepted qualification, language evidence and required documents.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":2}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Check accepted qualification, language evidence and required documents."}]]}],["$","li","Prepare a concise academic record and relevant supporting evidence.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":3}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Prepare a concise academic record and relevant supporting evidence."}]]}],["$","li","Submit through the correct university portal and save confirmation.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":4}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Submit through the correct university portal and save confirmation."}]]}],["$","li","Review admission and funding together before accepting or paying.",{"children":[["$","span",null,{"children":5}],["$","strong",null,{"children":"Review admission and funding together before accepting or paying."}]]}]]}],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://iro.sabanciuniv.edu/en/degree-students/frequently-asked-questions/admission-applications",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://iro.sabanciuniv.edu/en/degree-students/frequently-asked-questions/admission-applications","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Sabancı admissions FAQ"}]]}]]]}],"$undefined"]}]
27:["$","section","5-Housing and campus planning",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-6","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Housing and campus planning"}],[["$","p","Evaluate the actual campus location in Tuzla when comparing a room elsewhere in Istanbul. A lower rent can be offset by daily travel cost and time, particularly if your timetable finishes late.",{"children":"Evaluate the actual campus location in Tuzla when comparing a room elsewhere in Istanbul. A lower rent can be offset by daily travel cost and time, particularly if your timetable finishes late."}],["$","p","Ask for the covered room type, occupied months, summer arrangements and deposit treatment. If the award includes a room, confirm whether you must apply through a separate housing system. If it does not, request a current quote rather than assuming a graduate benefit is shared by undergraduate students.",{"children":"Ask for the covered room type, occupied months, summer arrangements and deposit treatment. If the award includes a room, confirm whether you must apply through a separate housing system. If it does not, request a current quote rather than assuming a graduate benefit is shared by undergraduate students."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","p",null,{"className":"table-source","children":["Official reference: ",[["$","span","https://dorm.sabanciuniv.edu/tr/yurt-ucretleri",{"children":["",["$","a",null,{"href":"https://dorm.sabanciuniv.edu/tr/yurt-ucretleri","target":"_blank","rel":"noreferrer","children":"Sabancı dormitory fee schedule"}]]}]]]}],["$","nav",null,{"className":"answer-links","aria-label":"Next steps for Housing and campus planning","children":[["$","$L4","/guides/student-accommodation-turkey/",{"href":"/guides/student-accommodation-turkey/","children":["Student accommodation in Turkey",["$","$L5",null,{"ref":"$undefined","iconNode":"$7:props:children:2:props:children:1:props:iconNode","className":"lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"}]]}]]}]]}]
28:["$","section","6-Before you accept a Sabancı offer",{"className":"article-section","id":"section-7","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Before you accept a Sabancı offer"}],[["$","p","Use the award letter as a checklist of real commitments. A practical comparison is the cost left after funding, plus the evidence that each benefit will be available when needed.",{"children":"Use the award letter as a checklist of real commitments. A practical comparison is the cost left after funding, plus the evidence that each benefit will be available when needed."}]],"$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined","$undefined",["$","$L29",null,{"id":"guides/sabanci-university-admissions-scholarships:section-7","title":"Check your progress","items":["I have the correct undergraduate, academic graduate or professional route.","I know whether the award is tuition-only or includes other benefits.","I have recorded payment months, duration and continuation conditions.","I have confirmed the actual room, deposit and travel plan.","I can cover remaining tuition and arrival expenses without an assumed award."]}],"$undefined","$undefined"]}]
